  "scenes": [
    {
      "name": "How it works",
      "text": "The title and what this film covers.",
      "startS": 0,
      "endS": 15.5
    },
    {
      "name": "Two names",
      "text": "Pravrudhi-Nyaya is the product; Prabhāsa-Nyāya is our own trained models; the system is a second reader that refers when it cannot support a statement.",
      "startS": 15.5,
      "endS": 40.2
    },
    {
      "name": "The corpus",
      "text": "Real judgments and orders are gathered, cleaned, read by two model readers, checked and split into training, held-out testing and evaluation sets.",
      "startS": 40.2,
      "endS": 78.2
    },
    {
      "name": "Element judges",
      "text": "Our trained models that read one ingredient at a time. An offence is broken into ingredients; a 4B judge scores each, a 32B judge checks the same ones, and the AND rule needs both.",
      "startS": 78.2,
      "endS": 112.1
    },
    {
      "name": "The harness",
      "text": "Deterministic assembly, the quote check, the Lean structure check and refer-first decide; no model decides.",
      "startS": 112.1,
      "endS": 149.89999999999998
    },
    {
      "name": "Nyaya grounding",
      "text": "Pramana, nirnaya withheld and agama, explained in plain words.",
      "startS": 149.89999999999998,
      "endS": 181.99999999999997
    },
    {
      "name": "The assistant",
      "text": "The optional Claude managed-agent assistant: consent, spending limits, and the core still decides. Offered to signed-in users; optional, with a consent box each run.",
      "startS": 181.99999999999997,
      "endS": 207.99999999999997
    },
    {
      "name": "Citations",
      "text": "An existence-only check against an index of judgments, and the rule that keeps a name match from counting as a verification.",
      "startS": 207.99999999999997,
      "endS": 246.99999999999997
    },
    {
      "name": "Serving and cost",
      "text": "Local machines plus serverless GPUs, a planned fallback endpoint, and what idle costs.",
      "startS": 246.99999999999997,
      "endS": 286.09999999999997
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluation discipline",
      "text": "Evaluation items are checked against training data, every look at the evaluation set is counted, and results that show no effect are reported.",
      "startS": 286.09999999999997,
      "endS": 326.2
    },
    {
      "name": "End card",
      "text": "Name, line and where the technical report lives.",
      "startS": 326.2,
      "endS": 337
    }
  ],
